From 647f29adb5025c6d6844faae1506cd45bddf0611 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Jonathan=20Waldsj=C3=B6?= <jonathan.waldsjo@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:45:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] radeon_hd: add hardware cursor support for DCE 4+

Implement the set_cursor_shape, set_cursor_bitmap, move_cursor and
show_cursor hooks using the Evergreen style CUR_* registers, as Linux
does for DCE 4 through 11. The 64x64 premultiplied ARGB image is kept
at the end of the mapped frame buffer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
